{
  "id": "pipe_velocity_calculator_with_flow_data___charts",
  "title": "Pipe Velocity Calculator with Flow Data & Charts",
  "description": "Calculate fluid flow velocity in circular pipes using Imperial and SI units. Supports calculations with volume flow rates and pipe inside diameters.",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Pipe Velocity Calculator with Flow Data & Charts\n\n## Imperial Units\n\nFluid flow velocity in a circular pipe can be calculated as:\n\n**v = 0.4084 × q_gpm / d_in²**\n\nWhere:\n- v = velocity (ft/s)\n- q_gpm = volume flow (US gal/min)\n- d_in = pipe inside diameter (inches)\n\n## SI Units\n\n**v = 1.273 × q / d²**\n\nWhere:\n- v = velocity (m/s)\n- q = volume flow (m³/s)\n- d = pipe inside diameter (m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Imperial Units Calculator"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "flow_rate_gpm",
          "label": "Volume Flow Rate",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "gpm (US gal/min)",
          "defaultValue": 60
        },
        {
          "id": "pipe_diameter_inches",
          "label": "Pipe Inside Diameter",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "inches",
          "defaultValue": 3.83
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "velocity_imperial",
          "label": "Flow Velocity",
          "formula": "0.4084 * inputs.flow_rate_gpm / (inputs.pipe_diameter_inches * inputs.pipe_diameter_inches)",
          "unit": "ft/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "SI Units Calculator"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "flow_rate_m3s",
          "label": "Volume Flow Rate",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m³/s",
          "defaultValue": 0.00378
        },
        {
          "id": "pipe_diameter_m",
          "label": "Pipe Inside Diameter",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "meters",
          "defaultValue": 0.0972
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "velocity_si",
          "label": "Flow Velocity",
          "formula": "1.273 * inputs.flow_rate_m3s / (inputs.pipe_diameter_m * inputs.pipe_diameter_m)",
          "unit": "m/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Pipe Schedule",
        "Nominal Size (in)",
        "Inside Diameter (in)",
        "Flow Rate (gpm)",
        "Velocity (ft/s)"
      ],
